### 4. Clean up the manuscript and project documentation
- Replace unnecessary TODOs and vague pending notes with completed analysis or a precise statement of the remaining evidence limitation.
- Remove duplicated explanations and redundant draft material.
- Ensure all tables, captions, units, terminology, and references are consistent.
